{"seq":1,"slug":"scientific-method","title":"科学方法","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/charles-darwin/ideas-and-methods/scientific-method","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"patient-observation-and-experiment","title":"耐心的观察与实验","url":"/c/people/charles-darwin/ideas-and-methods/scientific-method/patient-observation-and-experiment","wordCount":1739,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"one-long-argument","title":"\"一个长论证\"","url":"/c/people/charles-darwin/ideas-and-methods/scientific-method/one-long-argument","wordCount":1490,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 科学方法\n\n本章剖析达尔文的研究方法。他的成功不在于某次灵光乍现，而在于一种把海量观察与实验，编织成严密论证的能力。\n\n第一篇文档讲述他长期、耐心的观察与实验风格——从八年研究藤壶到晚年观察蚯蚓。第二篇文档分析《物种起源》作为\"一个长论证\"的结构：他如何以归纳与类比层层推进，使理论难以反驳。\n"}